OL,3,ANTSB says crucial plane parts found
OL,4,Athree miles from Florida crash site
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrucial components of a private jet
OL,7,Fthat crashed in Palm Beach, Florida -
OL,8,Fincluding a part that controlled the
OL,9,Fup-and-down movements of the nose of
OL,10,Fthe plane - were found 1.3 (2 km) to
OL,11,F3.8 miles away from the crash site, an
OL,12,Finvestigator said on Tuesday.
OL,14,FNational Transportation Safety Board
OL,15,F(NTSB) investigators said they believed
OL,16,Fparts of the jet may have broken off
OL,17,Fbefore the Sunday crash, which killed
OL,18,Fall nine on board.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
