OL,3,ANTSB says crucial plane parts found
OL,4,Athree miles from Florida crash site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe NTSB found "the majority" of the
OL,7,FLearjet's left elevator - a control
OL,8,Fsurface on the tail - in three pieces,
OL,9,FNTSB board member Tom Chapman said.
OL,11,FChapman said because the parts were
OL,12,F"quite some distance away" from the
OL,13,Fsite, investigators determined they
OL,14,Ffell off before impact.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
